WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.238
Marco Mendicino.

00:00:01.238 --> 00:00:08.431
Former Minister of Public Safety who oversaw CSIS, RCMP, firearms policy, and the Emergencies Act invocation.

00:00:08.431 --> 00:00:11.704
He told Parliament that police asked for the Emergencies Act.

00:00:11.704 --> 00:00:16.502
Both the RCMP Commissioner and Ottawa Police Chief testified under oath that they did not.

00:00:16.502 --> 00:00:19.681
He was later appointed Chief of Staff to PM Mark Carney.
